## frequency weights
let staff = dataset(staff).add(copies = to(floor(age / 10), Int))
staff.ivreg(productivity ~ training, instruments: training ~ offer, weights: copies, weight_type: frequency)

---
ivreg · productivity ~ training
N = 8,771 (the sum of the frequency weights over 2,400 rows)
